        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Woods is a solo and online co-op survival-crafting game set on a mysterious stylized forest island. Start with nothing, gather enough food and water to last the night, build a shelter, and turn a fragile camp into a defensible base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/b148213865ea443f4832b8abf31a8270.poster.avif?t=1782623118\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/b148213865ea443f4832b8abf31a8270.webm?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/b148213865ea443f4832b8abf31a8270.mp4?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and defend your camp</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct shelters, campfires, storage, fences, traps, and defensive structures as wildlife and hostile creatures threaten your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/58ed04181071f1501fbf4c59dd9f83fb.poster.avif?t=1782623118\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/58ed04181071f1501fbf4c59dd9f83fb.webm?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/58ed04181071f1501fbf4c59dd9f83fb.mp4?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive by preparation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, fish, cook, collect water, craft weapons, and plan each journey before hunger, thirst, weather, or enemies catch you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/db9429ab6bee213d2d8c50b3d616232b.poster.avif?t=1782623118\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/db9429ab6bee213d2d8c50b3d616232b.webm?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/db9429ab6bee213d2d8c50b3d616232b.mp4?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a dangerous island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search forests, beaches, rivers, caves, and landmarks for resources, secrets, and a possible way off the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/effa60cca46bf84e42aa7476f2ed7a73.poster.avif?t=1782623118\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/effa60cca46bf84e42aa7476f2ed7a73.webm?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/effa60cca46bf84e42aa7476f2ed7a73.mp4?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft tools, weapons, and materials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn raw resources into the gear you need to explore farther, fight back, and keep your camp alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/1abd9e8ffe095ad0cd179078b1d04133.poster.avif?t=1782623118\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/1abd9e8ffe095ad0cd179078b1d04133.webm?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/1abd9e8ffe095ad0cd179078b1d04133.mp4?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play solo or online co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive alone or team up with friends to divide building, hunting, gathering, crafting, and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Woods is a solo and online co-op survival-crafting game set on a mysterious stylized forest island. Start with nothing, gather enough food and water to last the night, build a shelter, and turn a fragile camp into a defensible base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/b148213865ea443f4832b8abf31a8270.poster.avif?t=1782623118\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/b148213865ea443f4832b8abf31a8270.webm?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/b148213865ea443f4832b8abf31a8270.mp4?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and defend your camp</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct shelters, campfires, storage, fences, traps, and defensive structures as wildlife and hostile creatures threaten your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/58ed04181071f1501fbf4c59dd9f83fb.poster.avif?t=1782623118\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/58ed04181071f1501fbf4c59dd9f83fb.webm?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/58ed04181071f1501fbf4c59dd9f83fb.mp4?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive by preparation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, fish, cook, collect water, craft weapons, and plan each journey before hunger, thirst, weather, or enemies catch you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/db9429ab6bee213d2d8c50b3d616232b.poster.avif?t=1782623118\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/db9429ab6bee213d2d8c50b3d616232b.webm?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/db9429ab6bee213d2d8c50b3d616232b.mp4?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a dangerous island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search forests, beaches, rivers, caves, and landmarks for resources, secrets, and a possible way off the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/effa60cca46bf84e42aa7476f2ed7a73.poster.avif?t=1782623118\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/effa60cca46bf84e42aa7476f2ed7a73.webm?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/effa60cca46bf84e42aa7476f2ed7a73.mp4?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft tools, weapons, and materials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn raw resources into the gear you need to explore farther, fight back, and keep your camp alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/1abd9e8ffe095ad0cd179078b1d04133.poster.avif?t=1782623118\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/1abd9e8ffe095ad0cd179078b1d04133.webm?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145950/extras/1abd9e8ffe095ad0cd179078b1d04133.mp4?t=1782623118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play solo or online co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive alone or team up with friends to divide building, hunting, gathering, crafting, and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
